    "DialogTitle": "Bucklebury11 Mayor",
    "PreviousBlocks": 1b,
    "DialogText": "When I was a child, my grandfather told me about the stories when the big hedge was built. He said it was because of the white wolves, which attacked our people in the year of the Fell Winter. But one day he came home and I saw the horror on his face. I asked if it was another wolf. But he was just quite. On his axe, no blood, but resin and splinters of wood. He hasn't spoken a word since that day, the shock was so deep. So if you ask me... Yes, I believe in these monsters.",
